{
  "uid": "acns-incident-investigation",
  "title": "ACNS Incident Investigation",
  "tags": [
    "acns",
    "demo",
    "aks"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "refresh": "15s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-30m",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "ds",
        "label": "Prometheus",
        "type": "datasource",
        "query": "prometheus",
        "current": {},
        "hide": 0
      }
    ]
  },
  "annotations": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "Demo steps",
        "enable": true,
        "iconColor": "orange",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "grafana",
          "uid": "-- Grafana --"
        },
        "target": {
          "type": "tags",
          "tags": [
            "acns-demo"
          ],
          "limit": 200,
          "matchAny": false
        }
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "checkout-api success ratio",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${ds}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 0.9
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 0.99
              }
            ]
          },
          "decimals": 1
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "area"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(rate(demo_requests_total{app=\"checkout-api\",result=\"ok\"}[2m])) / sum(rate(demo_requests_total{app=\"checkout-api\"}[2m]))",
          "instant": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "checkout-api p95 latency",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${ds}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 6,
        "y": 0
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 0.5
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 1.5
              }
            ]
          },
          "decimals": 2
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "area"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le)(rate(demo_request_duration_seconds_bucket{app=\"checkout-api\"}[2m])))",
          "instant": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "ACNS drops in checkout-demo (/s)",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${ds}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 0
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ops",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 0.1
              }
            ]
          },
          "decimals": 2
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "area"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(rate(hubble_drop_total{source=~\"checkout-demo/.*\"}[2m])) or vector(0)",
          "instant": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Ready inventory pods",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${ds}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 18,
        "y": 0
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 1
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 2
              }
            ]
          },
          "decimals": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "area"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(kube_pod_status_ready{namespace=\"checkout-demo\",pod=~\"inventory-.*\",condition=\"true\"})",
          "instant": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "1. Application impact: success ratio by workload",
      "description": "Application-side view (demo clients). Shows user impact, not the cause.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${ds}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 9,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 4
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 10
          },
          "min": 0,
          "max": 1
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (app)(rate(demo_requests_total{result=\"ok\"}[2m])) / sum by (app)(rate(demo_requests_total[2m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{app}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "2. Application impact: failed requests by result",
      "description": "timeout = packets not answered; dns_error = name resolution failed. Both look like failures to the app.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${ds}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 9,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 4
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 10
          },
          "min": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (app,result)(rate(demo_requests_total{result!=\"ok\"}[2m])) > 0",
          "legendFormat": "{{app}} / {{result}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "3. Latency: p95 request duration by workload",
      "description": "Slow dependency: latency rises for every caller while ACNS drops stay at zero.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${ds}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 9,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 13
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 10
          },
          "min": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le,app)(rate(demo_request_duration_seconds_bucket{app=~\"checkout-api|catalog-client\"}[2m])))",
          "legendFormat": "{{app}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "4. ACNS: packet drops by workload and reason",
      "description": "Source: Retina/Hubble drop counters attributed to Kubernetes workloads. policy_denied = NetworkPolicy.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${ds}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 9,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 13
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "pps",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 10
          },
          "min": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (workload,reason)(label_replace(rate(hubble_drop_total{source=~\"checkout-demo/.*\"}[2m]),\"workload\",\"$1\",\"source\",\"checkout-demo/(.*)-[a-z0-9]+-[a-z0-9]+\"))",
          "legendFormat": "from {{workload}} / {{reason}}"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "expr": "sum by (workload,reason)(label_replace(rate(hubble_drop_total{destination=~\"checkout-demo/.*\"}[2m]),\"workload\",\"$1\",\"destination\",\"checkout-demo/(.*)-[a-z0-9]+-[a-z0-9]+\"))",
          "legendFormat": "to {{workload}} / {{reason}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "5. ACNS: TCP SYN rate (connection attempts) by workload",
      "description": "Observed TCP connection attempts per workload. A blocked caller spends its time waiting for timeouts, so its attempt rate collapses. Use together with drops (4); the syn-ack counter is too sparse on this dataplane to use as a signal.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${ds}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 9,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 22
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "pps",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 10
          },
          "min": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (workload)(label_replace(rate(hubble_tcp_flags_total{source=~\"checkout-demo/(checkout-api|catalog-client).*\",flag=\"syn\"}[2m]),\"workload\",\"$1\",\"source\",\"checkout-demo/(.*)-[a-z0-9]+-[a-z0-9]+\"))",
          "legendFormat": "{{workload}} SYN/s"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "6. ACNS DNS: responses by return code",
      "description": "NXDOMAIN ('non-existent domain') = the name is wrong. DNS server answered.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${ds}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 9,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 22
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ops",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 10
          },
          "min": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (workload,rcode)(label_replace(rate(hubble_dns_responses_total{destination=~\"checkout-demo/.*\"}[2m]),\"workload\",\"$1\",\"destination\",\"checkout-demo/(.*)-[a-z0-9]+-[a-z0-9]+\"))",
          "legendFormat": "{{workload}} / {{rcode}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "7. ACNS DNS: queries sent vs responses received",
      "description": "Queries with no matching responses = DNS traffic is being blocked (not a bad name).",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${ds}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 9,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 31
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ops",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 10
          },
          "min": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (workload)(label_replace(rate(hubble_dns_queries_total{source=~\"checkout-demo/.*\"}[2m]),\"workload\",\"$1\",\"source\",\"checkout-demo/(.*)-[a-z0-9]+-[a-z0-9]+\"))",
          "legendFormat": "queries {{workload}}"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "expr": "sum by (workload)(label_replace(rate(hubble_dns_responses_total{destination=~\"checkout-demo/.*\"}[2m]),\"workload\",\"$1\",\"destination\",\"checkout-demo/(.*)-[a-z0-9]+-[a-z0-9]+\"))",
          "legendFormat": "responses {{workload}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "8. Resilience: inventory pods Ready",
      "description": "One line per pod name. A deleted pod disappears and a new pod name appears.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${ds}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 9,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 31
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 10
          },
          "min": 0,
          "max": 1
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "kube_pod_status_ready{namespace=\"checkout-demo\",pod=~\"inventory-.*\",condition=\"true\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{pod}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "How to read this dashboard",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 40
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Vertical markers** are scenario steps posted by `demo.ps1`.\n\n| Symptom | Where to look | Meaning |\n|---|---|---|\n| Success ratio falls, drops (4) rise, connection attempts fall (5) | panels 1, 4, 5 | NetworkPolicy denial (`policy_denied`) |\n| Failures are `dns_error`, rcode NXDOMAIN (6) | panels 2, 6 | Wrong hostname; DNS is healthy |\n| Failures are `dns_error`, queries without responses (7), drops from the client | panels 2, 7, 4 | DNS traffic is blocked |\n| Latency rises (3) for all callers, drops flat (4) | panels 3, 4 | Slow dependency, **not** a network drop |\n| Pod count dips (8), success stays high | panels 8, 1 | Self-healing worked |\n\nManaged dashboards for drill-down: [Drops (Workload)](/d/NetObsDropsWorkload6738) | [DNS (Workload)](/d/NetObsDNSWorkload6738)"
      }
    }
  ]
}